{"2895680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Below, Rusted Gods", "steam_appid": 2895680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/9fa51ace11342c0c85633d3d826e0f51.webp?t=1785330035\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention Operator, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been selected to oversee a critical mission. Our team of elite soldiers is set to descend into a newly discovered abyss, believed to lead to uncharted territories beneath the earth. Your role is to monitor the soldiers' progress, ensuring their safety and collecting data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/fd9784097c38c1e7cac6d3e83b586a64.webp?t=1785330035\" width=600 height=36 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/84b162e10b325ecc251509441e440ad0.poster.avif?t=1785330035\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/84b162e10b325ecc251509441e440ad0.webm?t=1785330035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/84b162e10b325ecc251509441e440ad0.mp4?t=1785330035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/e535fff84164190b2b1b28d535b8f77e.webp?t=1785330035\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they venture deeper, remain vigilant and provide guidance based on their transmissions. You will have access to a status monitor, a radar, a radio to scan various frequencies, and other equipment to assist in your mission.<br>Be aware that communication may become sporadic as they descend. Strange anomalies have already been detected, and the nature of the abyss remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/fd9784097c38c1e7cac6d3e83b586a64.webp?t=1785330035\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/198d56f9dfc9a11c47b7e38729d099be.poster.avif?t=1785330035\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/198d56f9dfc9a11c47b7e38729d099be.webm?t=1785330035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/198d56f9dfc9a11c47b7e38729d099be.mp4?t=1785330035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/ba276b8bb4e235433605cb1428d48910.webp?t=1785330035\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the unexpected and maintain operational readiness at all times. Prepare to face the unimaginable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End of message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/b86400b717d0c3c2e3e31e6c871fc933.webp?t=1785330035\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\